{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_10",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:acd9bdebd0b67d2ca39a3ffe0b4d38a41f02323688a0578b452d159916f2f27a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3c50f43da19ed6afccf1fa2c7e28698998671da671a34a5751845978fc7f75",
      "text": "照亮过去与未来的繁星",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48d43579a1ff77ee7bf817f9e794246c77dc028e21f01a5cd64c03cc23f706bf",
      "text": "JIF正式演出近在眼前，315 Production的\n偶像们在紧张与兴奋之中，\n对舞蹈与服装进行最后的检查。\n距离开演仅剩片刻，\n他们各自倾诉起心中的想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000047:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde9ae20a545cf305d5f25c2458465af716321b2fb89ec28902eb9a21ab4d67f",
      "text": "第10话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000047:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3c50f43da19ed6afccf1fa2c7e28698998671da671a34a5751845978fc7f75",
      "text": "照亮过去与未来的繁星",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000049:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f62a37ada9ed0695c470f944f2e6bc91f92ce483a23009359bef703305518a46",
      "text": "JIF当天",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc95627e7dc1af0aaf0d5f9a3419559e566e6bea34918fb35b5d0a4c0c9f8be9",
      "text": "终于到了JIF正式演出……！\n情绪简直Mega Hyper MAX啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de3bdffa87e2a4624ff12f1d9a50db96e08f16c29cfcebdea864e2b94332a121",
      "text": "今天的线上直播，\n学校的大家也都在看呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27d71cd0826ea0f3b0cab81f47bf8748dc369bdfbfec2d9c980578b5eb2a3dcd",
      "text": "何止学校，全世界都在看啊！\n我们超受关注的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822b6ad51b09d2c80346b52bbbe53ba9f6586b6692f1df6f168f0d1df92720c7",
      "text": "是的。毕竟315 Production是通过“投票名额”\n临时决定参加的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31d22dfe2c2458e3f71439c5333009ce73309428c7be438cc1838efb373d5f48",
      "text": "我想我们的存在在各种意义上，\n都吸引了不少瞩目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b78e1ec98c20ecf6b0cf44e00aeaf5f2ed27ed0c37099df4b3a42726e933618",
      "text": "……而且，还是打头阵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0928912ab582b7ad1535905984b4b40c8301802d2ce74377bd561f882a54e2b4",
      "text": "喂，演出还没开始吗。\n别让本大爷干等啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502afb60769a1feb3044307f9c886779f0642f96c7b6077ce70df5ccae0ea901",
      "text": "看来涟是迫不及待想快点登台了啊。\n要不要找个地方再稍微活动一下身子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ebf2fa1d926794790967e4ed6431af72f806efab0b14e1797bef7cf3df2087f",
      "text": "圆城寺先生，要去的话也算我一个。\n为了正式演出，我想把身子热得更开一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f20ae6f232912d4d951754874ccf101120026fded2e322d8441f250d5d98c58",
      "text": "呜～心跳根本停不下来。等待正式演出的\n这段时间，真是让人紧张呢。卷卷你觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a9baf590f2b968d602b38d1df9c7ab03c219e4626e4312169c3ebcede9b0c4b",
      "text": "我也很紧张啊。虽然想着演出后要吃的\n蛋糕来分散注意力就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bca05dbe30bb727093717f6e2a77cb3f608bdfd540585ab6bdefb2f364c1245",
      "text": "（比平时更加热闹的休息室……大家的\n干劲与紧张感，都能真真切切地感受得到）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7647d69864c80cee6ade15b17b6edf5b838b4fcd3a20bbd82b98a68ddd408f11",
      "text": "我泡了咖啡。冲得比较多，\n想喝的人请自便。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da79e1ce298ed00e1d989a394b853435c48b14d5e8e1cdb6a2c0dddfcd757586",
      "text": "给。这杯是给●●●●プロデューサー的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef09fa8de1220ed9b39bd7aff7113c155b35b53b1c2044f8c2dd7e2725507f7f",
      "text": "秀先生，谢谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a195cf3badde3f78f656f72536f9de5c26ce8b5979fd65fb609661f5d76db13",
      "text": "说起来在C.FIRST初次Live的时候，\n你也像这样泡了咖啡给我们喝呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0397aa9abbbb96b8a789b4b82e544d05994ad51a5aae1db4ff809bfb9fd2362e",
      "text": "有这回事吗。\n看来我还挺照顾制作人的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77f5e383f15cb81d8334ee71ef00f309dd4cc87f5c8a938426b18961b787f80d",
      "text": "哦，这股香味……是咖啡啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1794bbc5c0bcd24165ff6224b4b8abc4786e3973e247c0734a62dd6fec452625",
      "text": "是秀泡的吗。那我就不客气了！\n喝了热咖啡，心也就踏实了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c9137da9234510eb24b67ebebb181030e361f12e20c462eb4df5fe0231db33f",
      "text": "啊，那就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b23c0f4c6f736893e95f4435ad62c816103dc7c2f02eeea70a5d65420d04625",
      "text": "（……完全没注意到辉先生的双关冷笑话！\n也就是说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dabfaf5ce960d0a2b6ca21014228f92d38575accd950dbe0c90db2f56efd438b",
      "text": "秀先生。您果然，稍微有点紧张吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f4e32a47b4532d0a80bda02d9dbae5168b2ac92c809816845824d6f1d6249d",
      "text": "咦？啊，嗯，算是吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bab19f4c666865cee48783a771bc39e49ec361e092bcc8bb9c46e4eb1b07bb0f",
      "text": "虽说到今天为止经历过很多大风大浪，\n但这也算是其中最大的舞台了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd29ed959257c8f59e0931749229842d203752f251f33dc57b69dd200086632",
      "text": "话说回来，被你这么一吐槽我反而更紧张了。\n别对我恩将仇报啊，我可是给你泡了咖啡的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cacd902aeb501894fe925f76bcb7a528bd81f39f32b3364a2a024b13facb87a",
      "text": "对、对不起。\n我还以为说出来会轻松一些呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbbc0db09e47b8d4fec4ce1e96d125e89f1109fda54e54c1f7b00367e8975ddc",
      "text": "没事的啦，秀。我也很紧张嘛。不过，\n我比紧张更期待演出开始呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0994f4bb999310c1c01e40bf5169a26e77c06cc839c6653efe2458c37004dd9",
      "text": "我懂的，天道先生。\n毕竟走到这一步，都是大家一起努力过来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb032700f93eb1d507f15eefc2780f7130099b0f0c6091e91a1f8903cfc5cabf",
      "text": "能把自己掌握的实力在舞台上毫无保留地展现出来。\n一想到这里，整个人都兴奋起来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff3e5ba8e349bea7ba8d60cb277cea311883e946d0cd92db80694a7113e9c7fb",
      "text": "我也是，我也是！\n走到今天为止，大家一起努力完成了好多好多事情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339e87ca618414ed564c2caf7a32652d88b0ef5b291478ea4fb9091df4681dfb",
      "text": "在唱片店当了一日店长。\n在店内广播的工作里，也学到了好多好多词汇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b46d43a2ed641739508f18f14aefd60e7af5afed1c8634964ac431827447d34",
      "text": "也有人说是因为那份工作认识了我们，\n进而成为我们的粉丝呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8570ac6949263f0881869c30a2d079ef456a878223326fec2fc1ba3914881eef",
      "text": "这些事，要是去告诉还在便利店打工时的\n我，他肯定不会相信的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c7687e57b563f7adef79513f00d58eac1b3d66594702af4d288808699ff2d96",
      "text": "那时候，我们让大家都露出了笑容。\n所以今天在Live上，也一定能带来满满的笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f868970d302329c5dfad096f7864c759a6d528672b07690229020db744838a",
      "text": "听着大家的话，\n我也忍不住回想起许多事情来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3134ce9cd3292f5b003b302d2555e89cc76e0eb122b64147eee38ffcd47096c9",
      "text": "成为偶像之后的经历，每一件都令人难忘……\n不过感谢祭可能尤其让人印象深刻吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5379e9d1fc11fdfd6224c9f6c29bf4734b9b2612d04fb4a48c4665781fb79e3a",
      "text": "是啊。那时候见到的粉丝的家人们……\n今天也一定在为我们加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00843cee6d36474beabdb640ce320a4cb2b9834fc3a63170cee54406193069c",
      "text": "比那时更加充满活力的\nCafe Parade的舞台，今天就好好展现给大家看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c6c53a271ecb4b231befa3926183e9ca910e5661abb909a849e6a7837401d0b",
      "text": "唔！就让吾等以漆黑的咏唱术，\n好好填补渴求吾等的仆从们的空虚吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:491bea70d24c688ca87f24d2200c371aeb7d2a5a93c0f3730992c556ebe88476",
      "text": "粉丝的支持吗……确实，\n要是没有粉丝，我们根本走不到这里来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d35f4de2f9240cf6350d89dcfc7719b91a9784b377033588dcd0d70a88b4eb2",
      "text": "但还不止这些。唱歌跳舞原本都是门外汉的\n我们，之所以能成长到这个地步……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01010ad5039a2ef3b66931545712aa007c3d55b39cf9352f2d744d2422764136",
      "text": "啊啊，多亏了相互切磋琢磨的伙伴，以及\n●●●●●●●●●●番长的陪伴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1733a334b7cbc2d42c7363115e8451bc2ccc4c3bf4d18becca0a84020e01811",
      "text": "……粉丝、伙伴、制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b72aa986dedbdc6259989d064bc3b596f78d88212c893982594da199e259e391",
      "text": "我觉得无论缺少哪一个，\n我们今天都无法站在这座舞台上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_d:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a492f236ccc8fb18410c39041dc27301d53246eb07ebd5e8d8197634b4ed010d",
      "text": "正是因为大家都在，我们才变得更加强大，没有受挫，\n一步步走到了今天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2f32e5ec557b3f21ffa8848d0a82c692f340104e2c0d79f8e2c1a620f0c7604",
      "text": "大家都很热血嘛。\n这下我对正式演出越来越期待了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ae98eb27e009929d7038f9996a937443b17b34262176a9b7a8373956741afcd",
      "text": "（听着大家的这番话，\n连我也感到热血沸腾。这就是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ec5ae0224ae67a91c5b35df2f13c428d78779e3e8d3eb8d7701ddaf67ea3237",
      "text": "（315 Pro的偶像们所拥有的光芒与力量啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c29e72c208801ac79f2fbd91176bdadc3b6ee05fb6060548ef97977d8bacd573",
      "text": "……喂，你一个人在那感动什么呢？\n该不会觉得自己是个局外人吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bb802e396d4a7e01567a21990dca3da8d4b1ffe9e7e61ccbe05d565c25b8d7b",
      "text": "就是啊。我们能聚集在这里，\n最初的起点可就是你啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86d7a5013272b60ee1d40ff11cb79de21ae2b96b15d4842f10218e78defb6c86",
      "text": "……话说回来，既然能像这样聊聊天，\n早知道就不留那个言了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5e2b29b50673c5c41965188175c9ac49bea3da8cb7c5e2840d31b48f02495e8",
      "text": "那个？是指什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cde5c7c739211f49d6112ee5f833bc99743e0d72da87c2adc2ad04329fc87bf",
      "text": "没啥，回头看下手机吧！\n我在留言信箱里留下决心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75f62d4be567fce32743045a8bec9d84a24efe5496138fbc1b4b7e4169518bdf",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。不用我说你也知道，\n凭我们绝对能让演出大获成功的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db6b117343fe8d650acf0b73d07077faaa8cc9d2ad02d487beb31f4cbaebe5fd",
      "text": "毕竟，我有同伴在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e365ef3421b00ffc3719864a5c2982fd632f3826ab9c45f0b3e91ff1ddd12a9",
      "text": "而且是很多很多同伴。……因为在你带我\n来的这家事务所里，我明白了这一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd0328055d388a4093dc5e737e2335f94d05b7a3827129cb681a2ff2b31bc8a4",
      "text": "……时间差不多了。\n大家，要上咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e6ac0262b982092242ca5325f68903a35e447a566603c76e439a9816e588390",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人。今天我们彼此都要忙着筹备JIF，\n大概没多少时间说话，所以我就留个言了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:096fa1856e574c423a4494d6d57e652f73da947bc5bedf68aa7b5b71d75cc7d7",
      "text": "谢谢你一直以来的陪伴！……怎么搞得，突然像是在做\n最后的道别一样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b86e9590ab0f6e742a898e6b64241d8ae92df599e267068d1b03bcc88e2d3fa8",
      "text": "我只是想重新向你传达这份谢意，\n感谢你一路指引我们走到今天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47141e8957dad421a9d70e0123971f2ed3664d3f21767f26fd1d98469707431b",
      "text": "感谢你发掘了我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45b4798889d5e4cad4dcb641cfb6476619365d827aa454c653de9a4c6834c5c1",
      "text": "感谢你在315 Production，\n让我与最棒的伙伴们相遇。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8efe3e1c235945f96fa4a7b51db6c0606b1cf3e3d52628dec959f82ad8a343b9",
      "text": "以及让我们站上了JIF这么庞大的舞台……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d5c75b9f85944662b18254be8f86d2aebc24725d3ba7db79547babb58ce3bd3",
      "text": "虽然你说这是我们努力的成果，\n但并不止于此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d865bb24e956f02aa3b23dd87861ba7728a37ce16380d35ca64c4e7144fbebc",
      "text": "是因为有●●●●プロデューサー在支持着我们、\n和我们一同努力，我们才能站在这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:927c29cc08009b953ebda13705c1548b448126648a4b1abf441d2f2893301aac",
      "text": "我会向你证明，相中了我们的你的眼光绝没有错！\n所以，好好看着吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000197:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb730e566d15c98413cc61baeecd603ba548541a21a5904896b00f57d794716b",
      "text": "好好看清楚被你发掘的，\n我们所有偶像的身姿吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000207:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ba364cc62adc1c594748ec46c9546199dc2e30b09f27e536f73ca3197ebe5d6",
      "text": "喂，天道。你在磨蹭什么。要丢下你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000209:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18a4193261127b1aec941a7601ead1fce83971881ed2502c5cd92dbec1a5be4c",
      "text": "知道了！马上来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_e:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0358fec71e085823ab486f059bbbe00081b75c416611db2e05b6fd29f412aacc",
      "text": "就是这样，你听到这个的时候可能\n演出都已经结束了……待会儿见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000031:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7493bb7dfe0c9fadf11a9efd1868cb67fbdafb566db805ee611eb24b374bcb3b",
      "text": "JIF开演",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:217083b35d256d1d333420eadb81de8e78cd949798017a4fb9991ad8c335d1f3",
      "text": "（……大屏幕上打出了315 Pro的名字）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2251b1ba9c7721b627886cdf1e6288a202c00d28ecab090a63c9959542251fc0",
      "text": "（……但是观众的反应一般。\n嘛，到目前为止都跟预想的一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e845a86e394d0d9958ae60a9532a054db679f987a72710ae017c4cdfbe8728c",
      "text": "315 Pro，是那个“投票名额”进来的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b6e15b51dd6f27997fc205493d3c43c4cb838631f64f0bc6a1a0a2297213883",
      "text": "对。后来追加确定出演的那家。\n我不太了解他们就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279390b1ce40eb6c596a6120c2b8602a35a7dbe2fdb46370a6cede6cacc427f2",
      "text": "315 Pro——！加油啊——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4035612157b42d79cd84fde0da98777bbb2c88b90ef1c1a0422dcc9fd0f2c45",
      "text": "（……为了支持我们到今天的粉丝，\n我也要让这场演出成功！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c09fdb53976f76d2f499f51b03848cf4dd145286036264fde4a1f457d5376265",
      "text": "……呐，两位。\n虽然马上就要开始了，但要不要来那个？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:447518caf4840bd594405badaa5b790ad7d2efdf280a2a150eeec7b6d0d1290f",
      "text": "啊……嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0bf08dad94bf917832cd5fe850ff4348e7de62891a4b37bee13ad229ed6fffc",
      "text": "从走出商店街，到来到这里，\n总觉得就是一眨眼的工夫呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8249de7d1e6eadc0a34b63663fa1bc4c70b41c017b39b08c6fc2d4575467cce",
      "text": "嗯……但是，重要的东西，一直都没有改变。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4676f2f0ad3a023859c4ff131deec6168c55a2382b56e399c6eea34ba33d084f",
      "text": "我最喜欢实、恭二了。\n想和你们两个，一直保持笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d08d2aecf80dc6126eb642c728c815b5f3ddc7c920b1a5731a739832325093c",
      "text": "皮埃尔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85597d2d5c377c1ae193eee67a0211a5450e895a8fa305cd0e46bafce57de809",
      "text": "三个人一起，实现梦想。今后也要，一直奔跑下去！\n所以，Beit……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1242ade2fa4bf44e84766c05074ba7e05e94c3c08d6f18cc34ec4b3a1b75de7b",
      "text": "嘿——嘿——，哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7badde18021ae4d92ab6305ee167c8c7b2d922a205863c5bf8bd871d8b5ac1",
      "text": "……上吧，315 Production！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c87a737d9995c8deabd084e9dbf03998a2c217ee19b1a23185208c2617098a",
      "text": "我们是打头阵的315 Production！\n大家请多关照啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8414669922daffc32e0c556b3bec010ba34e278b3cb4e97189a674f9db4ce9d0",
      "text": "…我们要用我们的力量，打动大家的心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d4b1492965a02567ec7bfd84ced34b46330557f7b732d1aed52a90c0249ed78",
      "text": "我们要全速冲刺了，大家可要跟上哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7af496c836b888f942e929fda0c5430132d6d396ec75c59f905b1f1f2f7a64",
      "text": "……咦？还挺不错的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc44ef06792f71e31bc51452d6a1bc964209ba222f33fd62f3ec383b7ad1c1c4",
      "text": "感觉，是我挺喜欢的音乐风格呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd0dda832a80872a61c11d83782c098745c3214471e5e8b4c6de0fd01438617",
      "text": "涟君——！加油啊——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4aaa2105868fba017b560ef573bae5c8c4e46423ec35ac6bbc75bebd6cdc4de9",
      "text": "啊啊！？你谁啊你！\n少对本大爷指手画脚！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73608467405a21022bc43e547b961db8ec27fb0b60bf838bdc058977c23223f5",
      "text": "喂、喂，涟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf497efde89c78b54e4bc8a8f4a4c6c97226df4d55e87c394d6bd0705139992a",
      "text": "别向观众找茬。那个人是在为\n你这种家伙加油啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd93bc8c4a929b248835c30fd28ddce57471c7ae151d53a44bbae689b68471a4",
      "text": "本大爷才不需要那种东西。\n杂鱼就给我像个杂鱼一样，老老实实赞美本大爷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000182:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8230eb3876b80e725cb1b4ee2d4a805b31eca1cf277295656db67777fd991e72",
      "text": "要是敢说多余的话，\n本大爷记住你的脸一拳揍飞你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_g:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00de710de9f2ca610cfddf3d6e1f1895ea543c8557da465b6af4cc17d2410d0f",
      "text": "啊哈哈……这是他独特的粉丝福利，\n各位客人还请见谅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c4156df217bc712d5585d2007d50545ee7c29bb35c69cf8decad22ab7b49977",
      "text": "各位的脸庞，\n直到最后排都看得很清楚哦。谢谢你们的应援。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6991a76e24302d65871bb6581686b2b589905f48f18b008ca649bfbbbfbcde45",
      "text": "……话虽如此，还真是耀眼啊。\n被灯光映照出的观众的表情，以及心灵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2082d0622cf22dfa57140350d2c6574e00ec6adbc375dfdc41c930d1546bd9e7",
      "text": "是啊……如此打动人心的光景，\n竟然存在于陆地上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67668d55132a517225d26cab7a4834f715e5e65ebce33376942b9185f10482d5",
      "text": "粉丝福利，是对自己呢，还是对周围呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208d9eda08b1de2a0cf61edacb2beb3919092ee310dd3be7df6e19ab4b63a13c",
      "text": "呵呵，我在向你们挥手哦～\n谢谢你们的应援，我好好注意到了哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:358f05e662bd73bde14b7e2672b27f684a72b2696928a3301cb7409da18f4c8d",
      "text": "好了，克里斯先生和雨彦先生也别光顾着感动了～\n要把我们Legenders帅气的身姿展现给大家看喽～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d60d7258d6e0f1d8da28c2a59d45fe1098373884e4f2e2403a541aaa6f2c9271",
      "text": "确实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:945f695d1c91f59146e993a7c1602364d8aa834db50b285779de5b74bdd3eada",
      "text": "噢噢！喂快看，玄武。是转播的摄像机！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca12304c220937cd3f9fec718b60f2ffc08e73a2ac4644e9e3e51f6e20896aed",
      "text": "嚯。那就在这里\n让大家见识一下神速一魂的狠劲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95aff09790a1aa29090f95507c1261f113ecb42429647793227a6c539dad33f0",
      "text": "噢噢噢！\n在摄像机那头看着的，全世界的恶徒们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19387a6587171a11f453e98137b9d5b9c416df0621e545203caa343e5bdcb007",
      "text": "只要有我神速一魂在，任何恶行都休想逃过我们的眼睛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edc28a8304dfca515ca6eed601bb974219c35068f6869816da4ff35425ceb1fa",
      "text": "作恶的家伙，我们会好好收拾你们的！\n想要改过自新就趁现在……哈！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b3bb5acb2251f2c191469a0a4e3158cba51866d51482b1aa28a674ef556e42b",
      "text": "（糟、糟糕，跟观众席的女孩子对上视线了！\n得、得、得做点什么粉丝福利才行……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb6627a3583438ca57e2e59d2d3d1dc32ca7b8b06a903490590c1ee9d1c9dca",
      "text": "喵——！喵喵喵，喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_h:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1480a1e40914bcd06cdf055035b9c216f71a59e7c718cc7a8227236db2e797c2",
      "text": "替、替我解围……谢谢你啊，喵子！\n你也是最棒的伙伴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a486e2e3fbd96e98fa0706f70abfe11bc60c4b056ac6bd137caf47d090f2cfba",
      "text": "来吧。请尽情享受\nCafe Parade的舞台吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:783759de88f88711a71ef8ef0f1a5862b71db18cd88c05449825d9d5f1e73b2b",
      "text": "只要大家开心，\n我们也会变得更加更加开心哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:565808a97efde6e647b29c04f8ebff4ec6a6826d84f540e3554658775d1c9399",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你美妙的微笑。\n您的笑容，会成为我们的力量！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:425c0f4c1ea7ac7a42c3901c82c12745d1ed7cbc3ab28d9a80cb120d5c207a46",
      "text": "看到大家这么热烈，真是太好了。\n当然，我自己也很享受其中呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5275abb57e5314649d07fede724dee198433e2be21947bfdf6e816ebf355646b",
      "text": "唔，涌上来了，力量涌上来了！汝等那恍惚的双眸\n正在增幅吾之魔力！哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ade0287ce88fb23e5642b08252bd5c3fb5a87a40df4f339692e4c307f6d91ad5",
      "text": "要上咯——！不要移开目光哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d277db469653880c4fb76a704e2a810193096e10c9a53b61ec80fe84b81eb8ff",
      "text": "还没完呢！要把全场的气氛炒得更热！\n大家跟我冲啊——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000197:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7849df7fe8df79614c2faa59e2e67cdb5b7863fbcceda720c5ae18787ca81774",
      "text": "何止全场，要把全世界都炒热起来！\n大家，来比比看谁先冲到转播镜头前吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e958934a81df7d170edca41af2e2458902953c2928daa3d181b9e4ee23e79dd1",
      "text": "大家都闹得太疯了，完全忘记节奏分配了啊。\n明明演出还在中途……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000225:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a442979ee6232aa74cfb4fa9e1268f0e3782ce91d2dc613a50792f7b60dbea6",
      "text": "……不过，旬也很开心的样子。\n看……隼人他们在叫你了。走吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000326:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cfeee4035f6b3c5bb5024f276c45ebd65c30b72e6941c8f9a39254479eb48a2",
      "text": "真是惊人的热气呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000332:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32d6b54957aece9df08236039d06adc7ac9c87d83bbc2ad496ed848c3613a367",
      "text": "这就是，大家努力至今的成果呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000338:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e5b9c19720d08fe74d1805f467b5177c4893e807315c0cf9f5c1291d8d3e454",
      "text": "请看，贤君。不仅是现场，\n网络直播也沸腾起来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000389:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c436f9b39edaf3178a97488f591e4a02336de4e98623112563bdbe21f19b25",
      "text": "今年的JIF，英文留言好多啊。\n315 Pro在海外也很有人气吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000446:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:161f23612e00d0ecf6001fed2b3b82f3ddf6f4a3327eb1b483ebfd61acb36067",
      "text": "一定是以High×Joker的活跃为契机，\n成为粉丝的人们吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000482:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdc06926630ea5ee9e9e5f8bb0f2e3f11805aba81ab5d970e05203376ec477db",
      "text": "现在，这个舞台，\n正成为迈向世界的第一步呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000499:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3fc81bb5d32ad45a69b85799a2d837bdfc22f06b3963849becd74feaa9c6aa",
      "text": "舞台表演结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000506:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccf475fc6ed31613640fea5743842b97bdc2aeb024ab588a40cb1b891787eca9",
      "text": "听说今天的舞台\n也有很多海外的人看了，\n是真的吗<emoji>image_talk_emoji_02</emoji><emoji>image_talk_emoji_02</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000508:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a7749be76430b0c9e7dd6bd98bdf3792da256c76ccd8ab851aca8ea0525ff0e",
      "text": "是真的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000508:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f53637cb7c5c4fe1b4af6cb9b2e3bd679d8508c44afb4c9786c55824ceaf6033",
      "text": "是真的哦。网络直播里\n也有很多来自海外的观众留言呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000509:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c299412b17cbc0dd1b895c746184f4e5fe70f5e658bd582e934964433ff21c37",
      "text": "超级厉害的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000509:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c05cdca669f235cc78f1a3ded044b27983706305f58c0aeaef18b4b68150106f",
      "text": "留言多到都快看不过来了，\n超级厉害的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000517:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad5dffd81076e8f35c23a94c8c1be49895744fec4e1d3a5b3578e08f2c4bbf86",
      "text": "海外啊～\n我们也变得好厉害了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000519:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4f5702ce411541bde2c4cad59a4b16c5b6ab43c3240ef64cb1493e09823c08c",
      "text": "说不定会有海外媒体\n来采访我们呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000521:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10a86a5a6c4fa33473a79493ec068a688ed38829895bde05d0d051218a69993d",
      "text": "虽然我不否认有这种可能性，\n但你也太操之过急了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000523:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73daf65fdb1a0b044ec0fdf30d22c707412a97f15b8bc1ba9437ad96b0969e31",
      "text": "为了能变成那样，\n大家一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000525:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d65835d594dfc8a83fc6f47f10ebffaaa31d835522815aa62e2168c949fa24",
      "text": "因为想让更多的人，\n听到High×Joker的歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000527:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dd9b1f6b7b4628d51fd06ca8402331d71836d45f9f1d2c917adf877399d9316",
      "text": "说得对！让更多的人\n来听听我们的歌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_i:cmd-000529:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3232c133207d1416e6fc2d1c6dfa2cf85431f746c41a7abb4d67a516682a8a2",
      "text": "下次何止全世界，\n我们要把名号响彻到宇宙去！<emoji>image_talk_emoji_41</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5b3b50c0b92b38de45cd836ee61efba01412178d007f973161a59975d4c7544",
      "text": "JIF结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7b5e2df9ebce317d937e9b2715112ea46d2b142f3b3dabcf80f6383ec1af12",
      "text": "啊～已经精疲力竭了……\n剩下的体力只够走去冲个澡了啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a773f3e0e01354b28c25feb338628f007f929d414b8d70a454671292a2ea3594",
      "text": "淋浴间也得排队呢。\n看来还要花不少时间，先擦擦汗等着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:244b8a2dd556e120eda5cf080eee8b8d0190de68144f5e3975f02a01d6ddeb17",
      "text": "好——的。\n冬马君，帮我拿一下毛巾～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ea5e7dda130938baf09c920d1d1cf18cec6f589790f4b37ba67d34122f643c",
      "text": "拿你没办法。……嗯？这是什么？\n是封信啊。喂，你们两个看一下这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962bfd9834f255576129a3fb2efe31d57a9f67fb4e75cacf7e9dfc0fb075dfde",
      "text": "说是给Jupiter大人。\n看起来是给我们的，是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31362565fe000581c75bff0eb23435c224df40eff27e4f2bd4f389758ecb58ac",
      "text": "看起来……不像粉丝信呢。\n打开来看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000123:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed4c819cf3ccb022108f0de282ce88c4481a42fdaa88b78a3ebd054e72a5e82c",
      "text": "场馆走廊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43ce38dfdfb2cbbb5abc4c652732a953911a9a8d020d9d8a6a01aece5a17699f",
      "text": "快点啦，悠介！赶紧去冲澡了。\n后面还有人在等呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9b6b2f0d91530b5644a5dc982eef6a9c1ec9897b0adf99bdabf9cacaf37553",
      "text": "等等我嘛。我总觉得\n整个人轻飘飘的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02327624f08eeaca019b4249e41eadad663de5c7bfc0a860686f32a7138eba12",
      "text": "喂，你们几个。\n……是315 Production的W吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5d46240ba21ecc0703d411071095108fec862a6d832ef341186f10a2aef27d7",
      "text": "是这样没错，但……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de63b71d36693fe8d360239634476b1d84cc4b4448863429a2d4b783424ebbd1",
      "text": "你们也要参加“男极”吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ce234e945da23b5bfd97336ae96c8be45f5afae284d84860c014dc829815b1b",
      "text": "……“男极”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000192:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000204:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e933e8fce9a304382644c7a9a853aae1f8db66c9df11f345e0d4e78f03a3d1ed",
      "text": "啊，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000206:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb06b369d56b95a1a5ed94fe7d05781c4053070b626f5332d7ba0b90d62e8b9",
      "text": "今天的Live真厉害呢。\n我到现在心跳都还在扑通扑通跳个不停呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000208:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfef5e8ecef1279c3f9aee584654169232de49d7ea95a6c88358fe1d1bfb09a5",
      "text": "不过，Live结束后发生了一件奇怪的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000210:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94cf5d793b8cd6c439f37220cd6d5ecaebfac509a3e22e8d9219e769a6005098",
      "text": "回休息室的时候，被其他事务所的\n偶像搭话了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000212:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9c2267186e525977378a677c87a3159faf208f45ed12ad7cb610c82597eb024",
      "text": "是其他事务所的\n偶像吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000213:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e707e9105d7c5d8f293c99c2402daa750744644d20c7396eb15d2b2fc004a5d8",
      "text": "聊了些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000216:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baad78aa444e4a6f5460ba12bfae8d041fd79912ef5037b1d56c8b20173c7947",
      "text": "嗯，与其说是聊，倒不如说是\n被问了“你们也要参加男极吗”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000218:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b4313b2f7cd1f8aeffe74f33f6da83458978d2dd3c11f2192c8d658fd564c89",
      "text": "啊，就是那个！\n结果“男极”到底是什么玩意儿呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000220:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:584b40d22cc6f19e2c909650646cb7bae4ac70d5dad7e44f54564db75c29df29",
      "text": "来搭话的那个偶像，\n感觉也带着一股非比寻常的气场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000222:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03491ea1e15c596428709ad55f075eb66b634269456361f35fa9e3ca58ca8e5a",
      "text": "可是，那人只管自己说了就不知道走哪去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000224:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15ef87191f865c867e0e7788ce3a3c0f9d178ceb06a79275be3ee43f229ae0c",
      "text": "说起来，北斗君他们在休息室\n好像也说发现了信来着……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000226:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e7a9188e8f991903f85875b535d6962048d876455f7f57c7e86ce29b5b5f86d",
      "text": "难道跟那个有什么关系……等等，我还在跟监督通电话呢！\n对不起！总而言之今天辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000228:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:935fa7c08b3b10986c9fbf2b1d86ca1396e2c5d02327dc585291a75fbc48a337",
      "text": "关于男极的事，要是知道些什么了请告诉我们哦。\n那么，明天开始也请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000230:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:036572399844090363903e6c84340d4b082066cea5e407bd785498e2ac979ae3",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●监督，\n好好休息哦！回见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_j:cmd-000237:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9fddea0f3c75219b2e04fb5d525253140b59715edd9b83bb792b1c5be5da29",
      "text": "第1章　迈出步伐，向着闪耀的舞台　完",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
